# One Celery task (kombu 5.2 redis transport + redis result backend), from the
# per-command counts round one measured (~/chunky/data/mixed-pipelines/workloads/celery.txt):
# per task LPUSH, BRPOP, 3 MULTI/EXEC pairs, GET x2. Batch shape: 15013 multi-command
# batches = the 15009 transactions, 4 commands each; everything else is one command
# per round trip. Not replayed: SUBSCRIBE/UNSUBSCRIBE/PUBLISH outside MULTI (pubsub
# replies are not request/response), BRPOP (replaced by RPOP: closed-loop, no
# consumer to wait for), connection setup (PING, INFO, CLIENT SETINFO, SELECT).
LPUSH celery __V600__

RPOP celery

MULTI
ZADD unacked_index 1700000000.5 __ID__
HSET unacked __ID__ __V600__
EXEC

MULTI
SETEX celery-task-meta-__ID__ 86400 __V150__
PUBLISH celery-task-meta-__ID__ __V150__
EXEC

MULTI
ZREM unacked_index __ID__
HDEL unacked __ID__
EXEC

GET celery-task-meta-__ID__

GET celery-task-meta-__ID__
